# VRChat Udon extern surface — the OTHER HALF of `vrchat_udon_asm.sigs`.
#
# Rung 0: the extern signatures a rung-0 FBD-to-Udon emitter names in
# EXTERN / EXTERN_GET / EXTERN_SET operands to reach the world. The
# uasm side has the opcodes; this side has the strings those opcodes
# pass to the runtime's extern resolver.
#
# Source: vrchat-community/UdonSharp (MIT) — extern signatures are
# resolved through `UdonSharp.Compiler.Binder.BindContext` against
# VRChat's `UdonManager` at runtime. Signatures are stringly-typed:
# `<Namespace>.<Type>.<__Method>_<argTypes>_<retType>`. This file
# names the shape and gives the rung-0 subset our emitter uses.
#
# Format: `<extern-signature-string>  # <sense: GET|SET|CALL>  <notes>`

# ---- signature grammar --------------------------------------------
# `<Ns>.<Type>.__<Method>__<ArgType1>_<ArgType2>__<RetType>`
# Namespaces we hit: UnityEngine, VRC.SDKBase, VRC.Udon.Common
# Void return is written as `__SystemVoid`.

# ---- state observation (drives RFD 2149 done-flag polling) --------

VRCUdonCommonInterfacesIUdonEventReceiver.__RunProgram__SystemString__SystemVoid            # CALL  fire a named export
VRCUdonCommonInterfacesIUdonEventReceiver.__GetProgramVariable__SystemString__SystemObject  # GET   read a bound symbol
VRCUdonCommonInterfacesIUdonEventReceiver.__SetProgramVariable__SystemString_SystemObject__SystemVoid  # SET  write a bound symbol

# ---- scene actors (mirrors the Godot rung-0 shape) ----------------

UnityEngineGameObject.__get_activeSelf__SystemBoolean                                       # GET   is-active
UnityEngineGameObject.__SetActive__SystemBoolean__SystemVoid                                # CALL  activate/deactivate
UnityEngineGameObject.__GetComponent__T_UnityEngineTransform__UnityEngineTransform          # CALL  fetch transform
UnityEngineTransform.__get_position__UnityEngineVector3                                     # GET   world position
UnityEngineTransform.__set_position__UnityEngineVector3__SystemVoid                         # SET   world position
UnityEngineTransform.__get_rotation__UnityEngineQuaternion                                  # GET   world rotation
UnityEngineTransform.__set_rotation__UnityEngineQuaternion__SystemVoid                      # SET   world rotation
UnityEngineTransform.__get_localScale__UnityEngineVector3                                   # GET

# ---- math (host-side, called via extern rather than uasm ops) -----

UnityEngineVector3.__ctor__SystemSingle_SystemSingle_SystemSingle__UnityEngineVector3       # CALL  Vec3(x,y,z)
UnityEngineVector3.__op_Addition__UnityEngineVector3_UnityEngineVector3__UnityEngineVector3
UnityEngineVector3.__Distance__UnityEngineVector3_UnityEngineVector3__SystemSingle
UnityEngineQuaternion.__Euler__SystemSingle_SystemSingle_SystemSingle__UnityEngineQuaternion
UnityEngineMathf.__Sin__SystemSingle__SystemSingle
UnityEngineMathf.__Cos__SystemSingle__SystemSingle

# ---- timing (RFD 2143 GRAFCET clock, mapped onto Update) ----------

UnityEngineTime.__get_deltaTime__SystemSingle                                               # GET
UnityEngineTime.__get_fixedDeltaTime__SystemSingle                                          # GET
UnityEngineTime.__get_time__SystemSingle                                                    # GET

# ---- VRChat-only (players, networking, ownership) -----------------

VRCSDKBaseVRCPlayerApi.__get_LocalPlayer__VRCSDKBaseVRCPlayerApi                            # GET
VRCSDKBaseVRCPlayerApi.__IsOwner__VRCSDKBaseVRCPlayerApi_UnityEngineGameObject__SystemBoolean
VRCSDKBaseNetworking.__SetOwner__VRCSDKBaseVRCPlayerApi_UnityEngineGameObject__SystemVoid
VRCSDKBaseUdonBehaviour.__SendCustomEvent__SystemString__SystemVoid                         # CALL  named-event dispatch
VRCSDKBaseUdonBehaviour.__SendCustomNetworkEvent__VRCUdonCommonInterfacesNetworkEventTarget_SystemString__SystemVoid

# ---- input --------------------------------------------------------

UnityEngineInput.__GetKey__UnityEngineKeyCode__SystemBoolean                                # CALL
UnityEngineInput.__GetAxis__SystemString__SystemSingle                                      # CALL

# ---- rule for the emitter -----------------------------------------
# Every extern string above is a slot the UdonManager binds at world-
# load time. An unknown signature is a load-time reject (the world
# refuses to start); the emitter validates against this file at
# compile time so an unknown one fails at .uasm build, not at upload.
